      "href": "https://data.source.coop/lqgentner/glace-ch/tiles/glacier-fractions.parquet",
      "type": "application/vnd.apache.parquet",
      "title": "Per-tile glacier cover fractions (RGI7)",
      "description": "The share of each MGRS tile covered by RGI7 region 11 outlines, plain and buffered by 250 m, pinned to one inventory version. Computed once per scope rather than per year, so the same tile cannot carry different fractions in 2021 and 2024. This is the lookup behind the glace:glacier_fraction properties on every item, published so that a property nobody can recompute is at least auditable.",
      "roles": [
